OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and bright start to
OL,6,FWednesday, with any isolated mist or
OL,7,Ffog patches soon clearing. Becoming
OL,8,Frather warm through the morning, with
OL,9,Fsome patchy cloud developing. Winds
OL,10,Fremaining mostly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome clear spells to start
OL,13,FWednesday night, but soon becoming
OL,14,Fcloudy while remaining largely dry.
OL,15,FWinds light, though occasionally
OL,16,Fbreezy in the north. Mild throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
