OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FMostly cloudy and rather
OL,6,Fwarm Thursday, with the chance of a
OL,7,Ffew sunny spells developing later in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Remaining dry
OL,9,Fthroughout, with winds generally light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain at
OL,12,Ffirst on Friday will soon clear
OL,13,Fsoutheastwards, leaving sunny spells
OL,14,Fand isolated showers for the rest of
OL,15,Fthe period, most frequent across Kent
OL,16,Fand Sussex. Cooler and breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
